title ALES162 — Lotus's stereo_gate_env: the attack/release noise gate carried into stereo, the linked envelope driving one linked gate over time
prompt Keep going Lindy-first crux-first on the Lotus (ALES) ladder; approve my own design rounds; send each finished increment as its own signed round; stop at the custody gates.
think ALES161 fused the linked detector (ALES160) with the linked gain (ALES157) for the compressor — the representative time-varying rung, and its design read closed on the promise that proving the fusion opens the mechanical gate/limiter/expander versions. The next crux is the first of those three: the attack/release noise gate carried into stereo. The mono family crossed this exact seam at ALES54, one rung after the mono attack/release compressor (ALES53), spending ALES52's envelope to drive ALES51's silenced floor patiently.
think The shape spends both proofs: advance ONE shared envelope toward the linked peak by ALES160's stereo_env_step (attack rising, release falling); at or above the threshold both pass byte for byte; below it, gat = e·den/num on the ENVELOPE (ALES51's floor), one gain gat/e applied to BOTH raw samples. One detector, one gate, the image held. A shared envelope of exactly zero arises only when both channels are silent (asserted), so no divide by zero.
think The crux LINK: under unit attack+release the linked envelope is the instantaneous linked peak, so stereo_gate_env reduces to ALES156's memoryless stereo_gate byte for byte on both — the time-varying rung's zero-smoothing limit is exactly the memoryless rung already proven. Proven by running both tools on the same master.
obs First selftest run went RED on IndependentDidNotDiffer — my test-2 master let the release keep the right's own envelope above threshold the whole span, so mono gate_env(right) equalled identity and matched the shared right. Fixed the fixture (a loud head then a sustained quiet tail, release 1:2) so the linked envelope eases below threshold over the tail while the independent right closes on different samples. GREEN after.
obs Six laws GREEN on metal: the instantaneous law (== stereo_gate under unit coeffs on both); the linked-gate-over-time law (a left-always-peak master has left' == ALES54 mono gate_env(left), the right scaled by the same fraction, the independent push differing); the image law (out-of-phase pair returns still out of phase, no expansion, no sign flip); the knob laws (unit ratio identity, a slower release holds the gate open longer — the tail survives, monotone); the carry law (split == whole on both); the above-threshold/silence/balance/atomicity(five refusals)/degenerate law.
obs StereoGateEnvError = gate_env.GateEnvError reused whole; the fusion adds no fault. Purely local, siloed to lotus/; gain gat/e in [0,1], no overflow (i64). No custody gate reached — a self-approved design round.
loom witness=ales_stereo_gate_env_witness green=1 module=lotus/stereo_gate_env.rye laws=6
