file lotus/stereo_gate_env.rye the linked stereo attack/release gate — stereo_gate_follow_carry, stereo_gate_follow
file tools/ales_stereo_gate_env_witness.rish the trilingual witness (EN · Radiant · TAME), build + selftest GREEN gate
recommend keep-going — the family stays mechanical: stereo_limit_env (the brickwall envelope) and stereo_expand_env (the expander envelope) each wire the linked envelope into their memoryless stereo rung the same way, single-module, policy written, no seam.
